comfortable and relaxing to play. Playable either in the comfort of your home (MR mode) or in the middle of mysterious ocean (VR mode). Intuitive hand-tracking is also supported.\n\n{1080607603374929}\n", "short_description": "THE LOCK is a mixed reality puzzle adventure game featuring brain-teasing, artfully crafted puzzles that can be solved through magical locomotion and spatial teleportation. Player can plunge inside puzzles like in the movie \"Inception\". MR see-through and hand-tracking are both supported for more comfortable and intuitive gameplay."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FS8x5FSTlzzehIqNSESRjB7LBqhj-GkuHriRpBUXprM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skycamp Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://skycamp-studio.github.io/Home/the-lock/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29858759143768671"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392107_919073630212859_5645905122871550324_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XjlvOWAvwGwQ7kNvwGXqMFW&_nc_oc=Adkl4IBxkFHCWSLcX5JgD8v75Z5qnx53WxoSHgb3B6qB-xHCBmkxX9SHlJ5eE6Q-VOY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-